         "html": "<p>The dependable way is to redraw it. One-click converters and auto-trace tools copy every flaw in the image, scatter thousands of stray anchor points and usually mangle the text. Our designers rebuild the logo in Adobe Illustrator, shape by shape, using your AI image as the reference.</p><p>You end up with a light, editable master file that prints cleanly on a business card and a wall banner, cuts properly on vinyl, and gives an embroidery digitizer clean outlines to work from. Your web developer gets a crisp SVG instead of a fuzzy PNG.</p>",
