      },
      {
       "t": "heading",
       "level": "h2",
       "text": "AI Logo Cleanup Questions",
       "align": "center",
       "classes": []
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "accordion",
     "items": [
      {
       "q": "Can you fix a logo made with ChatGPT, Midjourney or Canva?",
       "a": "<p>Yes. We clean up logos from any AI image tool, including ChatGPT, Midjourney, DALL·E, Canva, Looka and Leonardo. Send the highest-resolution version you have and we rebuild it as vector artwork.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "What is the best way to convert an AI logo to SVG?",
       "a": "<p>Have it redrawn in vector software. We rebuild your logo in Adobe Illustrator and export SVG, EPS, AI and PDF files plus transparent PNGs. Free online converters tend to produce bloated files with distorted text.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Can you correct misspelled words in my AI logo?",
       "a": "<p>Yes. AI generators often scramble letters. We remove the broken text and set your business name in a matched or upgraded professional font with proper spacing.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "How long does it take to fix an AI-generated logo?",
       "a": "<p>Straightforward cleanups can often be finished the same day after review. Detailed illustrations or a full redesign take longer. Your designer confirms timing during the free audit, before work begins.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Do I need to pay before you start?",
       "a": "<p>No. There is no upfront payment. You review the proof, ask for changes, and pay once you are satisfied.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Will the cleaned-up logo work for embroidery, vinyl and large signs?",
       "a": "<p>Yes. Vector files are exactly what embroidery digitizers, vinyl cutters and sign printers ask for, and we can simplify fine details so the logo stitches and cuts cleanly.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Who owns the files after the cleanup?",
       "a": "<p>You do. When the project is complete, the final logo files are yours to use for your business.</p>"
      }
     ],
     "classes": []
    }
   ]
  },
